ires the Operation Guns DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Vlad_Tepes_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Vlad Tepes Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," have passives where Curse also affects their damage."]}]}}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 27 July 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["[1.15.114] Fixed Torrrona's box achievement"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 June 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Torrona's Box, ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:silver-ring"}," ",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:gold-ring"}," ",{"t":"Gold Ring","r":"passive:gold-ring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Left","r":"passive:metaglio-left"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Right.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-right"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Right","r":"passive:metaglio-right"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Outer_Saboteur.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"t":"Outer Saboteur","r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"}," are the only passive items with max level 9 instead of the usual 5."]},{"c":["This passive item is a reference to the ",{"t":"Pandora's Box","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pandora%27s_Box"}," where opening it unleashes all physical and emotional curses upon mankind with only hope left behind. Torrona's Box seems to be the opposite, in that all the good comes before bad."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Torrona is also likely a reference to ",{"t":"turrón","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turr%C3%B3n"},", an Italian nougat confection, in the similar way ",{"t":"pandoro","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pandoro"}," is, and both are traditionally served during the Christmas season."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}